By repeatedly losing all his crops,

00:30:19.217 --> 00:30:23.882
This former farmer decided to change his life and become a fisherman.

00:30:24.502 --> 00:30:28.126
A prime example of the Vietnamese people's ability to adapt.

00:30:45.561 --> 00:30:50.024
We can't go fishing far because unfortunately we only have a small boat.

00:30:51.045 --> 00:30:55.948
Since my brothers, a few friends, and I didn't have enough money,

00:30:56.509 --> 00:30:57.149
we put all our...

00:30:57.169 --> 00:30:58.150
our shared savings.

00:30:58.890 --> 00:31:01.352
And that's how I was able to buy a share of this boat.

00:31:02.552 --> 00:31:05.374
So there are five of us families sharing it in order to be able to work.

00:31:08.536 --> 00:31:09.316
But in this region,

00:31:09.517 --> 00:31:10.237
traditionally,

00:31:10.617 --> 00:31:11.798
There are two seasons in the year.

00:31:13.099 --> 00:31:13.739
For six months,

00:31:13.740 --> 00:31:14.820
The sea is rather calm.

00:31:15.700 --> 00:31:16.661
And for another six months,

00:31:16.662 --> 00:31:18.602
You could say she's rather agitated.

00:31:20.231 --> 00:31:21.492
But in recent years,

00:31:22.433 --> 00:31:23.033
Everything has changed.

00:31:24.054 --> 00:31:25.615
The tidal cycle is different,

00:31:25.735 --> 00:31:27.136
Water levels are changing.

00:31:28.157 --> 00:31:28.557
And now,

00:31:28.838 --> 00:31:29.678
the normal cycle,

00:31:29.738 --> 00:31:32.380
that is to say, the fact that the sea should change every six months,

00:31:33.461 --> 00:31:34.662
is no longer respected at all.

00:31:59.704 --> 00:32:02.507
Faced with the delta, which is subject to periodic flooding,

00:32:02.707 --> 00:32:05.050
to coastal areas invaded by sand,

00:32:05.490 --> 00:32:12.558
The concept of ecological villages emerged with the aim of restoring a more favorable ecological balance.

00:32:16.347 --> 00:32:18.408
Some villages in the Aitui district,

00:32:18.928 --> 00:32:19.368
where Mr. lives

00:32:19.668 --> 00:32:21.469
Nguyen Thanh Hen with his family,

00:32:21.889 --> 00:32:23.170
are genuine successes.

00:32:23.570 --> 00:32:32.474
We replanted and recreated a microclimate that favours the creation of orchards and ponds suitable for developing aquaculture ponds.

00:32:46.407 --> 00:32:50.453
By setting up a small fish farm near his home,

00:32:51.034 --> 00:32:51.154
Mr.

00:32:51.194 --> 00:32:59.326
Nguyen Thanh Hen has acquired a significant additional resource that fits directly into the coastal rehabilitation program.

00:33:11.271 --> 00:33:12.092
In this village,

00:33:12.392 --> 00:33:15.495
where there is a particular awareness of environmental issues,

00:33:15.875 --> 00:33:22.160
We do not hesitate to experiment with the advantages that biomass offers in addition to traditional wood-fire heating.

00:33:23.802 --> 00:33:27.084
Thanks to the presence of a pig farm near the kitchen,

00:33:27.665 --> 00:33:32.529
In a way, Madame Guyenne Tannhain enjoys an almost modern level of comfort.

00:33:42.896 --> 00:33:45.018
Gas is made from pig excrement.

00:33:53.026 --> 00:33:53.146
Yes,

00:33:53.767 --> 00:33:55.829
That's how this tank fills with gas.

00:33:57.130 --> 00:33:59.412
This allows us to cook directly on the stove.

00:34:02.335 --> 00:34:03.356
It's very practical.

00:34:14.403 --> 00:34:14.864
NOW,

00:34:15.344 --> 00:34:15.984
with gas,

00:34:16.404 --> 00:34:17.425
It's very comfortable.

00:34:18.585 --> 00:34:19.085
Formerly,

00:34:19.086 --> 00:34:20.486
They only cooked with wood.

00:34:21.106 --> 00:34:22.267
And it was very unpleasant.

00:34:23.547 --> 00:34:24.328
Whereas now,

00:34:25.628 --> 00:34:26.588
No more wood-chopping chores.

00:34:28.309 --> 00:34:29.370
Especially since I was the one who went.

00:34:35.012 --> 00:34:35.872
Paradoxically,

00:34:36.152 --> 00:34:37.493
in this district of Haiti,

00:34:37.933 --> 00:34:39.514
despite global warming,

00:34:39.754 --> 00:34:40.974
The temperature is dropping.

00:34:41.375 --> 00:34:42.555
Proof that anything is possible.

00:34:42.575 --> 00:34:43.135
always take action.

00:34:49.080 --> 00:34:49.560
Formerly,

00:34:49.620 --> 00:34:50.060
in our country,

00:34:50.761 --> 00:34:52.782
There were only large sand dunes.

00:34:53.783 --> 00:34:54.984
It was very, very hot.

00:34:56.185 --> 00:34:56.765
And today,

00:34:57.386 --> 00:34:59.007
even if we have storms and wind,

00:35:00.048 --> 00:35:00.768
with the trees,

00:35:00.769 --> 00:35:02.089
The weather is still much better.

00:35:02.990 --> 00:35:04.511
We can get into the shade now.

00:35:04.711 --> 00:35:05.513
Thanks to the foliage.

00:35:06.594 --> 00:35:06.895
Today,

00:35:06.896 --> 00:35:08.778
Nature is no longer what it used to be.

00:35:13.006 --> 00:35:14.889
If you want to live with us for a few more years,

00:35:15.250 --> 00:35:16.172
You need to eat.

00:35:18.455 --> 00:35:20.176
It was so hot back then.

00:35:20.677 --> 00:35:21.237
Tell,

00:35:21.938 --> 00:35:24.339
How did you manage to walk on the sand back then?

