You could barely set foot on the sand.

00:35:29.002 --> 00:35:29.583
Do you realize?

00:35:29.923 --> 00:35:31.884
Barely had I set foot on the sand.

00:35:32.144 --> 00:35:33.385
It was so hot.

00:35:34.486 --> 00:35:38.048
But I still needed to be able to walk on that sand.

00:35:39.229 --> 00:35:39.589
SO,

00:35:40.050 --> 00:35:41.811
I was forced to wear sandals.

00:35:41.851 --> 00:35:41.971
Yes,

00:35:42.291 --> 00:35:43.132
wear sandals.

00:35:43.152 --> 00:35:45.253
I was the only one.

