All the neighbors made fun of me.

00:36:00.824 --> 00:36:02.725
With the consequences of deforestation,

00:36:03.286 --> 00:36:05.207
The environment has been profoundly altered.

00:36:06.808 --> 00:36:07.949
Faced with these upheavals,

00:36:08.429 --> 00:36:13.293
The Vietnamese government has taken several initiatives with a number of organizations.

00:36:14.113 --> 00:36:16.396
to encourage people to protect the forest.

