Moreover,

00:36:19.579 --> 00:36:26.927
Reforestation programs have been launched so that rural inhabitants have a chance to one day rediscover the traditional Vietnamese forest.

00:36:51.742 --> 00:36:54.643
Reforestation guidelines are not new.

